#: ../../../tutorials/external_libraries.md:35
msgid ""
"Keyword arguments to the constructor are passed straight through to the "
"corresponding library's model."
msgstr "コンストラクタへのキーワード引数は、そのまま対応するライブラリのモデルへ渡されます。"

#: ../../../tutorials/external_libraries.md:59
msgid ""
"Passing a `Surrogate` instance to the `surrogate` argument works the same"
" as the `RBFSurrogate` example in \"Switching components\" in [Single-"
"Objective Optimization](single_objective.md) — internally it is wrapped "
"in a `LocalSurrogateManager`."
msgstr "`Surrogate`インスタンスを`surrogate`引数に渡す挙動は、[単目的最適化](single_objective.md)の「コンポーネントの切り替え」で示した`RBFSurrogate`の例と同じで、内部で`LocalSurrogateManager`にラップされます。"

#: ../../../tutorials/external_libraries.md:61
msgid ""
"See [Surrogate](../components/surrogate.md) for adapters aimed at "
"classification problems (e.g. feasibility classification) and the "
"detailed arguments of each adapter."
msgstr "分類問題向けのアダプタ（実行可能性分類など）や、各アダプタの詳細な引数は[Surrogate](../components/surrogate.md)を参照してください。"

#: ../../../tutorials/external_libraries.md:63
msgid "pymoo adapters"
msgstr "pymooアダプタ"

#: ../../../tutorials/external_libraries.md:65
msgid ""
"Each adapter wraps an already-constructed pymoo object and implements the"
" corresponding `saealib` base class, so it can be passed anywhere that "
"base class is expected."
msgstr ""
"各アダプタは構築済みのpymooオブジェクトをラップし、対応する`saealib`の基底クラスを実装しているため、"
"その基底クラスが期待される場所ならどこにでも渡せます。"

#: ../../../tutorials/external_libraries.md
msgid "Wraps"
msgstr "ラップする対象"

#: ../../../tutorials/external_libraries.md
msgid "`PymooCrossover`"
msgstr "`PymooCrossover`"

#: ../../../tutorials/external_libraries.md
msgid "A pymoo `Crossover` (e.g. `SBX()`)"
msgstr "pymooの`Crossover`（例：`SBX()`）"

#: ../../../tutorials/external_libraries.md
msgid "`PymooMutation`"
msgstr "`PymooMutation`"

#: ../../../tutorials/external_libraries.md
msgid "A pymoo `Mutation` (e.g. `PM()`)"
msgstr "pymooの`Mutation`（例：`PM()`）"

#: ../../../tutorials/external_libraries.md
msgid "`PymooAlgorithm`"
msgstr "`PymooAlgorithm`"

#: ../../../tutorials/external_libraries.md
msgid "A pymoo `Algorithm` (e.g. `NSGA2()`, `DE()`)"
msgstr "pymooの`Algorithm`（例：`NSGA2()`、`DE()`）"

#: ../../../tutorials/external_libraries.md
msgid "`PymooProblem`"
msgstr "`PymooProblem`"

#: ../../../tutorials/external_libraries.md
msgid "A pymoo `Problem` (a benchmark, or existing research code)"
msgstr "pymooの`Problem`（ベンチマークや既存の研究コード）"

#: ../../../tutorials/external_libraries.md:74
msgid "`PymooCrossover`/`PymooMutation` drop straight into `GA`:"
msgstr "`PymooCrossover`/`PymooMutation`は、そのまま`GA`に組み込めます。"

#: ../../../tutorials/external_libraries.md:107
msgid ""
"`PymooAlgorithm` reuses a whole pymoo algorithm's own search and survival"
" logic, and `PymooProblem` reuses an existing pymoo problem definition "
"unchanged:"
msgstr ""
"`PymooAlgorithm`はpymooアルゴリズム全体の探索・生存選択ロジックをそのまま再利用し、"
"`PymooProblem`は既存のpymoo問題定義をそのまま再利用します。"

#: ../../../tutorials/external_libraries.md:129
msgid ""
"`PymooAlgorithm` runs in \"engine mode\": the wrapped pymoo algorithm "
"owns its own population and internal survival state, and `ctx.population`"
" is refreshed from it after every generation rather than being the source"
" of truth. See [Algorithm](../components/algorithm.md) for what this "
"means in practice (no checkpoint/resume, `n_offspring` is ignored, and "
"`PreSelectionStrategy`'s partial `tell()` needs an explicit opt-in)."
msgstr ""
"`PymooAlgorithm`は「エンジンモード」で動作します。ラップしたpymooアルゴリズムが自身の集団と内部の生存選択状態を保持し、"
"`ctx.population`は正のデータではなく、世代ごとにそこから更新される値になります。 "
"これが実際に意味することについては[Algorithm](../components/algorithm.md)を参照してください"
"（チェックポイント/再開は非対応、`n_offspring`は無視される、`PreSelectionStrategy`の部分的な`tell()`には明示的なオプトインが必要）。"

